{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Iridium Band is a ",["l","戒指","ring"]," that can be ",["l","打造","crafted"]," after earning the recipe at ",["f","Combat_Skill_Icon.png",24]," Combat Level 9. The ingredients are 5 ",["l","铱锭","Iridium Bar"],"s, 50 ",["l","太阳精华","Solar Essence"],"s, and 50 ",["l","虚空精华","Void Essence"],"s. It may also be found in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Fishing level 2"],". Additionally, it can be obtained by killing monsters as a ",["l","矿井#Special Items","special item"]," in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," during the ",["l","任务#Danger In The Deep","Danger In The Deep quest"]," or after activating the ",["l","矿井#Shrine of Challenge","Shrine of Challenge"],"."]],["p",["The Iridium Band combines the effects of the ",["l","光辉戒指","Glow Ring"],", ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],", and ",["l","红宝石戒指","Ruby Ring"],". Its effects stack with another Iridium Band, a ",["l","光辉戒指","Glow Ring"],", a ",["l","辉石戒指","Glowstone Ring"],", a ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],", or a ",["l","红宝石戒指","Ruby Ring"],"."]]]],["Dyeing",2,[["p",["Iridium Band can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a purple dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]]]}